{
  "id": "31_reference_marks",
  "function": "reference_marks",
  "note": "Which marks and flows count for a suggestion's quarter, by hand (docs/08 section 12, 'Which marks and flows count'): latestLockedBefore, lockedForOrAfter and hasFlowBetween, with previousQuarterEnd and quartersBetween behind them. A mark counts for the quarter end it is within seven days of, else for its own date. The reference is the latest Locked mark that reports for a date before the suggestion's quarter end; flowsSinceReference is hasFlowBetween from the reference mark's own period end to the suggestion's quarter end, and null with no reference.",
